摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Go-based local development orchestrator for Magento, Laravel, Symfony, Next.js, WordPress, and more. Docker stacks, SSL, Xdebug, and a desktop dashboard.","id":"gh:1152886960","install_available":false,"language":"Go","name":"govard","slug":"ddtcorex/govard","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dev-tools","django","docker","docker-compose","drupal","dsh-plugin","go","golang","laravel","local-development","magento","magento2","mageos","nextjs","shopware","symfony","wordpress","xdebug"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Go-based local development orchestrator for Magento, Laravel, Symfony, Next.js, WordPress, and more."},{"id":"p1s2","text":" Docker stacks, SSL, Xdebug, and a desktop dashboard."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# GOVARD: Go-based Versatile Runtime & Development"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Govard** is a professional-grade local development orchestrator engineered in Go. It replaces lega"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"cy bash-based tooling with a fast native binary that manages complex containerized environments with"},{"id":"p3s3","text":" a focus on stability, speed, and developer experience."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## 🆚 Why Govard Stands Out"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Area | Govard Advantage |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| Core architecture | Native Go binary with direct Docke"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"r SDK orchestration instead of shell-script glue. |\n| Framework intelligence | Automatic framework d"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"iscovery + framework-specific blueprints + custom stack wizard. |\n| Magento depth | First-class Mage"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"nto/OpenMage workflow (auto `env.php`/`local.xml` wiring, table prefixes, Varnish/Redis/queue/search"},{"id":"p5s5","text":", dedicated `php-debug` routing). |\n| Local HTTPS/DNS | Built-in Caddy + `dnsmasq` + Root CA auto-tr"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ust for `*.test` domains. |\n| Remote safety | `remote`/`sync` protections for sensitive targets (pro"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"d write blocking, scoped capabilities, audit logs). |\n| Deployment | A framework recipe drives a neu"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"tral task pipeline (`deploy`), a container sandbox rehearses it locally, and an artifact mode keeps "},{"id":"p5s9","text":"CI jobs toolchain-free. |\n| Team reproducibility | `govard lock` + `lock.strict` to detect environme"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"nt drift across machines. |\n| Recovery workflow | `govard snapshot` for quick local DB/media checkpo"},{"id":"p5s11","text":"ints before risky operations. |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 🚀 Key Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **First-Class Deployment**: `govard deploy` publishes a revision over SSH + rsync with a framework"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" recipe, atomic symlink swap or in-place publish, maintenance windows, database backup, verification"},{"id":"p7s3","text":", rollback and resume — plus `govard sandbox` to rehearse the pipeline against a container on your m"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"achine.\n- **Remote Management (Flagship)**: named remotes with scope-based capabilities (`files,medi"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"a,db,deploy`), flexible auth (`keychain`, `ssh-agent`, `keyfile`), safe sync with dry-run planning, "},{"id":"p7s6","text":"and connectivity diagnostics (`govard remote test`).\n- **Shared SSH Gateway**: `govard-proxy-sshd` g"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ives every sandbox a stable address (`ssh -p 2222 <project>@127.0.0.1`, sftp included) instead of an"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" ephemeral port.\n- **Infra Host Access**: Elasticsearch/OpenSearch at `http://<project>.test:9200` a"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"nd the RabbitMQ management UI at `http://<project>.test:15672` — per-project Caddy routes, no extra "},{"id":"p7s10","text":"config.\n- **Framework Discovery**: Magento 1/OpenMage, Magento 2, Mage-OS, Laravel, Next.js, Emdash,"},{"id":"p7s11","text":" Drupal, Symfony, Shopware, CakePHP, PrestaShop, WordPress, and Django, plus an interactive custom-f"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"ramework wizard.\n- **Zero-Config Debugging**: Xdebug 2 & 3 with one-click toggling and project-speci"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"fic isolation.\n- **Database Observability**: live query monitoring (`govard db top`), progress bars "},{"id":"p7s14","text":"for imports/syncs, Redis/Valkey management.\n- **Static Analysis & Profiling**: `govard audit` (lint,"},{"id":"p7s15","text":" integrity, profiler) with persisted sessions, diffs, and reruns.\n- **VSCode Integration**: `govard "},{"id":"p7s16","text":"vscode setup [--global]` runs Intelephense, PHPStan, PHPCS, PHPUnit, and Xdebug inside the container"},{"id":"p7s17","text":".\n- **Global Services**: Caddy proxy, Mailpit, PHPMyAdmin, Portainer out of the box.\n- **Team Safety"},{"id":"p7s18","text":" Nets**: snapshots, drift detection, 1Password (`op://`) secret references, resumable transfers.\n- *"},{"id":"p7s19","text":"*CLI + Desktop**: the same engine in a terminal binary and a Wails desktop app; `govard self-update`"},{"id":"p7s20","text":" with checksum validation."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 🛠️ Installation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Pick one channel and stick to it:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Channel | Command | Notes |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| npm | `npm i -g @ddtcorex/govard` | Node 20+, CLI only, any OS |\n| Homebrew | `brew install ddtcor"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ex/tap/govard` | macOS + Linuxbrew, CLI only |\n| Docker | `docker run ghcr.io/ddtcorex/govard:<versi"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"on> version` | No install needed; CI-friendly |\n| CI | `uses: ddtcorex/setup-govard@v1` | GitHub Act"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ions, pinnable version |\n| Script | `curl -fsSL .../install.sh \\| bash` | Full installer (CLI + Desk"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"top where supported) |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The installer handles system dependencies, starts global services, and configures SSL trust. By defa"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ult it also installs `govard-desktop` on Linux where `WebKitGTK 6.0` and GTK 4 are available (Ubuntu"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" 24.04+, Debian 13+); pass `--cli-only` to skip Desktop explicitly, or let the installer fall back t"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"o CLI-only automatically where WebKitGTK 6.0 is missing (Ubuntu 22.04, Debian 12, and every non-Linu"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"x platform). Tagged releases also ship `.deb`/`.pkg` installers, including a separate `govard-deskto"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"p_<version>_linux_<arch>.deb` — see the releases page and the installation guide for the full option"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"s. Do not mix channels on one machine (conflicting binaries across `/usr/bin` and `/usr/local/bin`)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Govard runs without Docker for host-side commands (`govard capabilities` lists every command's requi"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"rement); container-backed commands exit `3` with `CAPABILITY_MISSING` instead of failing midway. Det"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ails: Runs Without Docker."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Contributors build from source (`./install.sh --source -y`, needs Go 1.25+, Node 24+ and pnpm for th"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"e desktop); see CONTRIBUTING.md."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 💻 Usage"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 0. Try it without a project"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Recorded on 2026-11-04 from a real run on the machine this project is built on;\nthe dependency insta"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ll in the middle is cut and idle time is capped at one\nsecond. What the command costs, its flags and"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" its limits are on the\ntry page."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Real output from a run on a warm machine (trimmed to the last lines):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 1. Initialize and start"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 2. Remotes and sync"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`prod` remotes are write-protected by default; file/media sync is resumable rsync. Full docs: Remote"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"tes are write-protected by default; file/media sync is resumable rsync. Full docs: Remotes and Sync."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### 3. Deployment"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Rehearse against a container first, or split the build off to CI:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Full guide: Deployment\n- Worked configurations (Luma, Hyvä, themes, modes, webroots): Deployment c"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e: Deployment\n- Worked configurations (Luma, Hyvä, themes, modes, webroots): Deployment case studies"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
